{"2983660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Joker's Game", "steam_appid": 2983660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/420c0ed0cc71cf4abf1717c7ab92725d.avif?t=1766629091\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into a deadly game filled with dangers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Joker's Game&quot; transports you to a mansion created by a mysterious organization, where the brutal rule of &quot;survival of the fittest&quot; prevails. The game features lethal, upgraded versions of childhood classics where you must fight to survive. Can you trust your companions? Your most trusted ally might deliver a fatal backstab!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/2daa5f118e041f6cd12ab3adc6b9991c.poster.avif?t=1766629091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/2daa5f118e041f6cd12ab3adc6b9991c.webm?t=1766629091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/2daa5f118e041f6cd12ab3adc6b9991c.mp4?t=1766629091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Temptation-Filled Battle Royale Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Joker's Game, you'll meet many companions. Some offer genuine friendship, while others have hidden agendas. On this dangerous journey, who will you choose as your staunchest ally? Who will share the ultimate prize with you? Everything depends on your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/71a87b6644f2ff741eb066163ed360eb.poster.avif?t=1766629091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/71a87b6644f2ff741eb066163ed360eb.webm?t=1766629091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/71a87b6644f2ff741eb066163ed360eb.mp4?t=1766629091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles and Games Create an Thrilling Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Joker's Game is no mere celebration of violence - each challenge tests your wits and strategy! In the &quot;Sugar Art Challenge,&quot; draw intricate patterns with chocolate sauce; in &quot;Maze Escape,&quot; decode visual illusions to find the exit. The game features multi-layered puzzle mechanics: vote strategically using &quot;minority rule&quot; to eliminate rivals, employ psychological warfare, and cooperate temporarily with allies while watching for betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/84ab3cc8e854314e6c859dc4a920e26b.poster.avif?t=1766629091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/84ab3cc8e854314e6c859dc4a920e26b.webm?t=1766629091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/84ab3cc8e854314e6c859dc4a920e26b.mp4?t=1766629091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choices Determine Your Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You think winning the prize brings freedom? This is just the beginning of a greater conspiracy...&quot; The game reveals the dark truth behind this paradise through branching storylines. Among the participants are debt-ridden gamblers, undercover police, and elites seeking redemption. As the story progresses, discover the organizers' true motives: a rich man's gambling entertainment, a front for human experimentation, or a brutal metaphor for class society. Your choices shape the story's branches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/4077774209a5ee0e59c0c56945afde96.poster.avif?t=1766629091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/4077774209a5ee0e59c0c56945afde96.webm?t=1766629091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/4077774209a5ee0e59c0c56945afde96.mp4?t=1766629091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden levels reveal the laboratory's eerie secrets. &quot;Here, fairness is the greatest lie; survival is the only rule.&quot; Join The Joker's Game now - uncover the truth or become a victim of the conspiracy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/7d5abbfae65d8c4469e54b1413e948eb.avif?t=1766629091\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras_big/7d5abbfae65d8c4469e54b1413e948eb.avif?t=1766629091 width=800 height=458 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.